1
00:00:01,320 --> 00:00:02,535
I, Xu Yan, a student—

2
00:00:02,591 --> 00:00:03,377
my exam paper was switched!

3
00:00:03,905 --> 00:00:04,987
Whoever beat the drum,

4
00:00:06,030 --> 00:00:07,158
come before the court!

5
00:00:07,926 --> 00:00:09,429
I'll fetch the headmaster.

6
00:00:11,696 --> 00:00:13,732
You say your paper was switched.

7
00:00:13,804 --> 00:00:14,378
Where's your proof?

8
00:00:15,119 --> 00:00:16,182
The top paper on the list,

9
00:00:16,242 --> 00:00:16,790
I wrote it myself.

10
00:00:17,641 --> 00:00:19,669
The handwriting on this paper

11
00:00:19,758 --> 00:00:21,797
is Wei Xun's.

12
00:00:22,383 --> 00:00:23,245
Wei Xun,

13
00:00:23,445 --> 00:00:23,822
what do you say?

14
00:00:24,575 --> 00:00:26,389
My conscience is clear.

15
00:00:26,454 --> 00:00:28,638
A country Scholar

16
00:00:29,240 --> 00:00:31,726
gone mad dreaming of being Jieyuan.

17
00:00:31,810 --> 00:00:33,675
Slandering an examiner:

18
00:00:34,455 --> 00:00:37,130
thirty strokes, and stripped of your title!

19
00:00:39,004 --> 00:00:39,805
Handwriting can be copied,

20
00:00:39,884 --> 00:00:41,163
but an essay can't be.

21
00:00:41,623 --> 00:00:42,733
Your Honor, give us paper and brush,

22
00:00:42,788 --> 00:00:44,433
and he and I will write it from memory, right here.

23
00:00:44,498 --> 00:00:45,570
Absurd!

24
00:00:45,625 --> 00:00:46,419
Throw him out!

25
00:00:48,638 --> 00:00:49,381
Whoever beats the drum,

26
00:00:49,886 --> 00:00:51,325
this court will hear him.

27
00:00:52,417 --> 00:00:53,923
One stick of incense is your limit.

28
00:00:53,997 --> 00:00:54,653
Begin.

29
00:00:57,269 --> 00:00:58,843
Lift the water with waterwheels,

30
00:00:58,917 --> 00:01:00,635
not waiting on the heavens.

31
00:01:01,463 --> 00:01:02,317
Make way,

32
00:01:02,414 --> 00:01:03,426
Headmaster Cheng is here!

33
00:01:03,647 --> 00:01:04,814
I stood as his guarantor,

34
00:01:04,883 --> 00:01:05,922
so I've come to listen.

35
00:01:06,405 --> 00:01:07,344
Headmaster Cheng,

36
00:01:07,821 --> 00:01:09,185
please, sit.

37
00:01:10,009 --> 00:01:11,115
Word for word?

38
00:01:11,413 --> 00:01:12,974
Dark circles under his eyes,

39
00:01:13,226 --> 00:01:15,226
he didn't sleep all night.

40
00:01:15,309 --> 00:01:16,058
Memorized it overnight,

41
00:01:16,524 --> 00:01:17,460
that must've been hard on you.

42
00:01:19,650 --> 00:01:20,064
Recite away.

43
00:01:20,123 --> 00:01:21,601
Let's see how far you get.

44
00:01:24,805 --> 00:01:26,193
Word for word.

45
00:01:26,267 --> 00:01:27,914
Slandering an examiner,

46
00:01:27,990 --> 00:01:29,390
thirty strokes!

47
00:01:31,243 --> 00:01:32,529
Order——

48
00:01:33,086 --> 00:01:34,344
in court——

49
00:01:34,961 --> 00:01:35,740
Xu Yan!
